\item[S2] W. K. Hayman and E. F. Lingham, \emph{Research Problems in Function Theory} (2018), Chapter 2, Problem 2.29 and Update 2.29; Problem 2.28, equation (2.5). \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.07200}.
